 his \u001b[3X\u001b[10;79H\u001b[1K\rwork.\u001b[11;79H\u001b[1K\r\nOne day, Jack found a note in a bottle on top of the lighthouse. The note was \u001b[1X\r\nwritten in an unfamiliar language, and it was difficult for Jack to read it. \u001b[2X\r\nHowever, he couldn't resist the urge to open it. Inside the bottle, he found a \r\nletter from someone named Sarah who had been stranded on a deserted island.\u001b[4X\u001b[16;79H\u001b[1K\r\nSarah had been walking along the beach when she had found herself lost in the \u001b[1X\r\nvast ocean. She had been drifting for days, and she had eventually found \u001b[6X\r\nherself on the island where Jack lived. She had been living on the island for \u001b[1X\r\nmany years, and she had become very lonely and desperate.\u001b[22X\u001b[21;79H\u001b[1K\r\nJack was heartbroken to hear of Sarah's \u001b[39X\u001b[23;79H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[2;81H$ demo/kill_serving.sh\u001b[K\u001b[3;81Hanswer is served by replica :8002\u001b[K\u001b[4;81Hprocess group 7378\u001b[K\u001b[5;81H$ kill -9 -7378\u001b[K\u001b[6;81Hreplica :8002 is dead\u001b[K\u001b[7;81H$ \u001b[K\u001b[8;81H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[22;41H"]
